- [NEW] `xs2a.tech26.de` **sandbox data plane is route-identical to the live tier**, not a reduced mock: 7 of 8 fresh sandbox classes return 401, including payment-initiation `payments/sepa-credit-transfers`, `payments/instant-sepa-credit-transfers`, `periodic-payments/sepa-credit-transfers/{id}`. Sandbox ≥14 classes, live ≥23. Sandbox `funds-confirmations/{id}` → 404 (documented POST-only → uninformative per my 09-26 rule).
