| `xs2a.tech26.de/oauth2/authorize` | **8.2** | a=8, b=9, t=10 (OAuth redirect_uri/state), g=9 (anonymous 401, no pre-auth validation), c=7, f=8 |
| `api.tech26.de/api/accounts/{id}/*` | **7.7** | a=7, b=9, t=6, g=4 (strict Bearer firewall), c=7, f=6 |
| `app.n26.com` (new: WAF-confirmed on web tier) | **5.1** | a=5, b=8, t=7, g=6, c=6, f=6 |

