270:> Please note that the endpoints that can be accessed are dependent on the role stated in the QWAC certificate. A PIS certificate is required to access the PIS endpoints, and an AIS certificate is required to access AIS endpoints. This is true for all our interfaces; whether you wish to access the dedicated, fallback or sandbox interface. TPPs can possess an AIS certificate, a PIS certificate or both. Access and refresh tokens are also different depending on whether the call to the API is AISP or PISP.
