## STEP 1 — DELTA

- **[NEW]** `n26/psd2-tpp-docs` `doc/redirect/dedicated-{aisp,cbpii,pisp}.md` (fetched this cycle, 100KB): `TPP-Redirect-Preferred`/`TPP-Redirect-URI`/`TPP-State` are documented on **production** Berlin-Group paths — `POST /v1/berlin-group/v1/consents`, `POST /v1/berlin-group/v1/consents/confirmation-of-funds`, `POST /v1/berlin-group/v1/payments/{sepa-credit-transfers,instant-sepa-credit-transfers}`, `POST /v1/berlin-group/v1/periodic-payments/sepa-credit-transfers` — on `xs2a.tech26.de` with a production QWAC (L26-29, L229, L94). My committed `[NEXT] RAG` question is answered: **production, not sandbox-only**.
