26:Security layer: A valid QWAC Certificate for PSD2 is required to access the Berlin Group API. The official list of QTSP is available on the [European Comission eIDAS Trusted List](https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/tl-browser/##/ "https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/tl-browser/##/"). For the N26 PSD2 Dedicated Interface API, the QWAC Certificate must be issued from a production certificate authority.
