167:| TPP-Redirect-Preferred | Must be set to `true` to select the Redirect SCA approach. Mandatory for this flow.                               |
168:| TPP-Redirect-URI       | The URI N26 redirects the PSU back to after SCA. Mandatory when `TPP-Redirect-Preferred=true`.                    |
169:| TPP-State              | Opaque value echoed back on the redirect callback so the TPP can correlate the response. Optional but recommended. |
171:> :warning: If `TPP-Redirect-Preferred` is `true` but `TPP-Redirect-URI` is missing or malformed, the
172:> request is rejected with `400 Bad Request` and a `FORMAT_ERROR` message.
