367:    TPP->>PSU: redirect browser to scaRedirect URL
370:    App-->>PSU: redirect to TPP-Redirect-URI?state=... (success)
380:2. The TPP creates the funds-confirmation consent with the `TPP-Redirect-Preferred: true`,
381:   `TPP-Redirect-URI` and (optionally) `TPP-State` headers.
382:3. N26 responds with `ASPSP-SCA-Approach: REDIRECT` and a `scaRedirect` entry in the `_links` object.
