384:5. The `scaRedirect` URL is a Universal Link (iOS) / App Link (Android). If the N26 app is installed it
387:7. N26 redirects the PSU back to the TPP's `TPP-Redirect-URI`:
388:   - On success: `TPP-Redirect-URI?state=<TPP-State>` (the `state` parameter is omitted if no
389:     `TPP-State` was provided).
390:   - On failure: `TPP-Redirect-URI?error=access_denied&state=<TPP-State>`.
398:The `scaRedirect` base URL depends on the environment:
400:| **Environment** | **scaRedirect URL**                                                     |
407:When the SCA cannot be completed, N26 redirects the PSU back to the `TPP-Redirect-URI` with an `error`
413:| state               | The value provided in the `TPP-State` header on consent creation, echoed back so the TPP can correlate the callback. Omitted if no `TPP-State` was sent. |
