818:- 2026-10-01 ACCEPTED OTHER @ `xs2a.tech26.de`: the AS performs **no** pre-auth discrimination of `TPP-Redirect-*`. Four legs — headers absent, `Preferred` only, `URI: not-a-url`, `URI: 169.254.169.254` — all returned `401|0` with empty body, md5 `d41d8cd9`. This is the retirement rule for the 401-collision family, established the strongest way yet: a **within-batch 4-leg differential on one endpoint**, instead of the cross-day comparisons that produced the two earlier false positives. The `400 Bad Request` promised by `doc/sandbox.md` L142 for a malformed redirect URI is therefore unreachable pre-auth, which retires the STEP 5 discriminator and bounds HYP 1 to post-auth verification only.
